# What the checks look at is what is emitted: where code is verified, the verifier runs once more behind the sweep, on the swept code.
# THE LIE, testing=SweepTurnsBranchThatDecidesIntoJump: in each unit the sweep turns one branch whose other side is entered by another way too into a jump to its taken side. The Narrowed behind it stays.
# The verifier's run in front of the sweep sees nothing of it: the build went through under check=Validate, and the program died where it ran.
